       }\n        .category {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #e8f4f8;\n            color: #0066cc;\n            padding: 3px 8px;\n            margin: 2px;\n            border-radius: 3px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n        }\n        .abstract {\n            margin: 30px 0;\n        }\n        .abstract h2 {\n            font-size: 20px;\n            color: #333;\n            border-bottom: 2px solid #ddd;\n            padding-bottom: 10px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .abstract-content {\n            text-align: justify;\n            color: #444;\n            font-size: 15px;\n        }\n        .actions {\n            margin: 30px 0;\n            padding: 20px;\n            background-color: #f0f7fb;\n            border-radius: 5px;\n        }\n        .btn {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 10px 20px;\n            margin: 5px;\n            background-color: #b31b1b;\n            color: white;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n        .btn:hover {\n            background-color: #8b1515;\n        }\n        .btn-secondary {\n            background-color: #0066cc;\n        }\n        .btn-secondary:hover {\n            background-color: #004d99;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <h1>arXiv.org</h1>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"paper-container\">\n        <div class=\"paper-id\">arXiv:2410.09876</div>\n        \n        <div class=\"title\">BrowseComp-ZH: Benchmarking Web Browsing Ability of Large Language Models in Chinese</div>\n        \n        <div class=\"authors\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"author\">Zixuan Wang</a>, <a href=\"#\" class=\"author\">Yifan Liu</a>, <a href=\"#\" class=\"author\">Chenyu Wang</a></div>\n        \n        <div class=\"metadata\">\n            <div class=\"metadata-item\">\n                <span class=\"metadata-label\">Submitted:</span> 15 October 2024\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"metadata-item\">\n                <span class=\"metadata-label\">Last Updated:</span> 15 October 2024\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"metadata-item\">\n                <span class=\"metadata-label\">Categories:</span> <span class=\"category\">cs.CL</span>, <span class=\"category\">cs.AI</span>, <span class=\"category\">cs.SE</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"actions\">\n            <a href=\"http://127.0.0.1:8034/pdf/2410.09876\" class=\"btn\">Download PDF</a>\n            <a href=\"/html/search?q=BrowseComp-ZH:\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">Find Similar</a>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"abstract\">\n            <h2>Abstract</h2>\n            <div class=\"abstract-content\">\n                We present BrowseComp-ZH, a comprehensive benchmark for evaluating the web browsing capabilities of large language models in Chinese. Unlike existing benchmarks that focus on English or general QA tasks, BrowseComp-ZH specifically targets the ability of LLMs to navigate Chinese websites, extract relevant information, and complete browsing-based tasks. Our benchmark consists of 1,000 carefully crafted web browsing tasks across diverse domains including news, e-commerce, government services, and educational resources. We evaluate 10 popular LLMs and find significant performance gaps between Chinese and English browsing capabilities. Our code and dataset are available at https://github.com/RLBDLab/BrowseComp-ZH.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
